 "strings": [
  "",
  "The battle over Gryps",
  "was moving into its final phase.",
  "Gryps 2 could fire on colonies,",
  "on the moon's surface,",
  "and, if it chose, on Earth itself;",
  "seizing it, it was thought,",
  "would give the greatest",
  "possible advantage",
  "in the Earth Sphere.",
  "The AEUG and the Titans",
  "had massed nearly all",
  "their space forces",
  "in this one area,",
  "and kept slugging it out",
  "with nothing in reserve.",
  "This was because both",
  "were at heart mere pieces of",
  "the Federation Forces, unable",
  "to wage a long war.",
  "Once again, Bask's blunder,",
  "turning the factory plant Gryps 2",
  "into a laser cannon in his haste",
  "for glory, had come back",
  "to bite him.",
  "Had they dragged it into a war",
  "of endurance, backed by Luna II",
  "and Gryps 2, they might perhaps",
  "have beaten the AEUG.",
  "But history does not speak in ifs.",
  "In fact, the Titans,",
  "surrounded by the AEUG and Axis,",
  "were being wiped out.",
  "It looked as if a giant, a Titan,",
  "beset by countless humans,",
  "were dying with",
  "a final scream of agony.",
  "Scirocco",
  "\"Do you hear me,",
  " entire Titans fleet!\"",
  "\"This",
  " is the last will of",
  " His Excellency Jamitov Hymem!\"",
  "\"Chairman Jamitov",
  " has been assassinated",
  " by Haman Karn!\"",
  "\"Her aim is",
  " for the Zeon remnants",
  " allied with the AEUG\"",
  "\"to rule the Earth Federation",
  " government!\"",
  "\"Should that come to pass,",
  " the Titans...\"",
  "\"will find themselves condemned",
  " as a coup faction against",
  " the Earth Federation Forces!\"",
  "Bask heard the speech",
  "on the bridge of the Dogosse Giar",
  "and flew into a rage.",
  "Bask",
  "\"A speech by Scirocco!?\"",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Yes...\"",
  "\"Cut it!\"",
  "\"A brat who couldn't even",
  " finish off that vixen",
  " doesn't get to lecture us!\"",
  "\"Chairman Jamitov",
  " was murdered by that bastard!\"",
  "Yazan",
  "\"That's how you wanted it, right?",
  " Now you run the show.\"",
  "\"Now that it's come to this,",
  " if petty little men like the AEUG",
  " would just get prickly...\"",
  "\"I can crush them all",
  " without playing the villain...\"",
  "Scirocco's Last Sortie",
  "The Titans' Chances",
  "\"...Tch, how unpleasant,",
  " this sensation.\"",
  "Reccoa",
  "\"Huh...!?\"",
  "\"Fighting with raw emotion bared...",
  " At this rate, expecting dignity",
  " from people is hopeless.\"",
  "\"Just as I thought: people must",
  " be guided to something better.",
  " They need an absolute leader.\"",
  "\"When this battle is over,",
  " will people change?\"",
  "\"We will change them.",
  " And the one to do it, Reccoa,",
  " may well be you.\"",
  "\"...I have staked",
  " everything on you.\"",
  "\"I know...",
  " I can see how things stand now!",
  " The rest is simple.\"",
  "It was now that a man named",
  "Paptimus Scirocco",
  "first stepped into the public eye.",
  "Until then, Scirocco",
  "may have been known to a few,",
  "but he had never once",
  "stepped onto the main stage.",
  "He had always carried himself",
  "merely as the designer",
  "of new mobile suits",
  "like the Gabthley and Hambrabi,",
  "and as the captain",
  "of the Dogosse Giar.",
  "At most, those around him",
  "probably saw him as a dandy",
  "in an all-enamel custom uniform,",
  "his hair gleaming",
  "with pomade.",
  "Even now, Scirocco had not",
  "formally placed the Jupitris,",
  "his own command,",
  "under the Titans.",
  "The Earth Federation Forces",
  "might be acting under the Titans,",
  "but strictly as regular forces",
  "cooperating with the Titans.",
  "Scirocco, claiming",
  "his superior was the Jupiter fleet,",
  "refused to come under",
  "Bask's command.",
  "Yet the Jupitris held",
  "a near-limitless store of helium-3",
  "and an arsenal plant within it:",
  "a ship that could develop",
  "mobile suits on its own.",
  "Though no match for Gryps,",
  "it carried strategic weight enough",
  "to hold",
  "the casting vote.",
  "Had he wished,",
  "he could even have sent it",
  "crashing into Earth",
  "as a colony bomb: it had",
  "that much mass.",
  "But Scirocco",
  "killed Jamitov and claimed",
  "command of the Titans",
  "for himself.",
  "In truth, who really held",
  "at that point,",
  "no one can say.",
  "The Titans were a private army",
  "built at Jamitov's whim,",
  "with no system",
  "to settle such a question.",
  "As a result, the Titans",
  "split into a Scirocco faction,",
  "a Bask faction,",
  "and a herd of fence-sitters",
  "meekly following orders,",
  "and ended up fighting the AEUG.",
  "Yet Scirocco did have",
  "confidence that he,",
  "a fresh new leader,",
  "had captured the hearts",
  "of the young officers.",
  "Otherwise he would never",
  "have sortied in person",
  "in a mobile suit.",
  "The political climate of the time",
  "weighed heavily",
  "against the Titans.",
  "The AEUG's propaganda war",
  "had begun to pay off.",
  "Above all,",
  "the rumor that",
  "Char Aznable,",
  "Amuro Ray and Bright Noa",
  "had joined the AEUG and Karaba",
  "carried an overwhelming",
  "destructive power.",
  "Each of them was a hero",
  "of the One Year War,",
  "revered as a champion",
  "by friend and foe alike.",
  "It was the same admiring gaze",
  "that, before modern warfare,",
  "had been turned on knights",
  "and samurai on horseback.",
  "In this era, the custom",
  "of giving great warriors their due,",
  "whatever their creed or cause,",
  "was widespread.",
  "The heroes of the old White Base",
  "had joined hands with Char,",
  "the Zeon prince who, in disguise,",
  "had brought down the Zabi family,",
  "and together they fought",
  "for the freedom of humankind.",
  "The truth was not",
  "so simple a story,",
  "but it was without doubt the image",
  "the people wanted, even longed,",
  "to believe.",
  "Onto that stage came Haman Karn,",
  "a beauty who endured every trial",
  "to guard a young princess",
  "and fought at the front herself.",
  "Of course, it was not that",
  "the Titans paid no mind",
  "to such images.",
  "Their stylishly",
  "redesigned uniforms",
  "and the line of mobile suits",
  "painted in Titans colors",
  "were clear proof that they cared",
  "about how they looked.",
  "That is exactly why,",
  "driven into this corner,",
  "they cast off Jamitov's scheming.",
  "As the strongest elite unit",
  "of the Earth Federation Forces,",
  "they chose to crush every rebel",
  "head-on, by sheer force.",
  "Then the public would fall silent,",
  "and they could seize full control",
  "of the Assembly by force.",
  "Just as one who kills a god",
  "can no longer remain human,",
  "so one who fells a hero",
  "can be no ordinary man.",
  "A band of ordinary men,",
  "the Titans,",
  "for the most primitive aim",
  "of all, survival,",
  "resolved to face the oncoming",
  "army of heroes head-on.",
  "Gryps Laser",
  "Quattro",
  "\"Ngh!!",
  " I can't let Scirocco",
  " destroy the laser cannon!\"",
  "\"I can't let them hit",
  " the Titans fleet...",
  " Where's the core...?\"",
  "\"Is that it?!\"",
  "Haman",
  "\"Scirocco...",
  " out to wreck the laser cannon...",
  " How amusing!!\"",
  "\"Ngh! Any more damage",
  " and it won't be able to fire...",
  " Tch!\"",
  "\"Heh heh... come here to die,",
  " Chaaar!!\"",
  "\"Ugh!!\"",
  "Inside an abandoned colony",
  "not far from Gryps 2,",
  "the Newtypes were preparing",
  "for their final battle.",
  "The Radish had already sunk,",
  "and the Titans fleet",
  "was about to follow.",
  "The battle was over.",
  "The Titans",
  "won a victory, once,",
  "but they lost their leader",
  "and the people's support,",
  "and charged down the road to ruin.",
  "were dismissed",
  "as an anti-Federation force,",
  "a pack of coup plotters,",
  "and the Earth Federation",
  "set about purging",
  "every trace of the Titans.",
  "Of those who remained,",
  "some rose in armed revolt",
  "and some, it is said,",
  "joined Axis,",
  "but most either returned",
  "to their original units",
  "or, as war criminals,",
  "vanished into history's darkness.",
  "The era sank",
  "ever deeper into turmoil,",
  "but in that history, those who",
  "had once served in the Titans",
  "would never again",
  "show their faces.",
  "Only one tale survives:",
  "some 70 years on, a lone ship",
  "of the Alexandria class, nearly",
  "scrapped, fought as one wing",
  "of a resistance movement--",
  "or so it is said.",
  "Slowly, but surely,",
  "the center of the age",
  "was shifting into space.",
  "Universal Century 0088.",
  "　",
  "Taking as their symbol the Gryps,",
  "the beast that bears royal jade,",
  "in the end, never won glory's star",
  "and were scattered across space."
 ]
